<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bioc="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn/biocolor/1.0" xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail" targetNamespace="https://fluxbank.local/architecture" exporter="FluxBank architecture documentation" exporterVersion="2">
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_outbox" name="FluxBank | Outbox retry / stale recovery" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:laneSet id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_outbox_lanes">
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_outbox_detect" name="Detect">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_outbox_record" name="Record">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask1" name="Stale PROCESSING claim (&gt;5 min)&#10;OutboxRecoveryScheduler.recover()&#10;→ recoverStaleBatch(20)">
      <bpmn:documentation>Every 60 seconds. REQUIRES_NEW TX. findStaleForRecovery(cutoff,batchSize): ORDER BY claimed_at,id LIMIT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED. Recent/locked claims skipped. Crash after producer ACK can enter this path.
Sources: OutboxRecoveryScheduler.recover() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxRecoveryScheduler.java:24; OutboxRecoveryService.recoverStaleBatch() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxRecoveryService.java:23</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask2" name="Publish / result exception&#10;OutboxFailureService.recordFailure()&#10;REQUIRES_NEW">
      <bpmn:documentation>Lock row and compare OutboxAttempt snapshot; stale worker cannot overwrite a newer claim. Bookkeeping failure does not erase original failure.
Sources: OutboxFailureService.recordFailure() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxFailureService.java:20</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask3" name="Consume failure budget&#10;OutboxEvent.recordFailure()&#10;attempts++; sanitized last_error">
      <bpmn:documentation>Recovery calls recordFailure(true,...); normal failure uses retry classification. Retryable: transient/recoverable DB, CannotCreateTransactionException, Kafka RetriableException. Unwrap only CompletionException, ExecutionException, KafkaException. attempts counts failures/recovery, not claims.
Sources: OutboxEvent.recordFailure() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/domain/OutboxEvent.java:105; OutboxRetryPolicy.isRetryable() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxRetryPolicy.java:49; OutboxRetryPolicy.delay() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxRetryPolicy.java:35</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow4" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask1" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask3" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow5" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask2" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask3" />
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway6" name="Retryable and attempts &lt; 5?">
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow7" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask3" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway6" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask8" name="PENDING + scheduled backoff&#10;5s → 10s → 20s → 40s&#10;Normal poller claims when due">
      <bpmn:documentation>next_attempt_at=now+min(5s*2^(attempt-1),5m); claimed_at=null. No direct publish from recovery. Stable eventId reused; duplicates remain possible.
Sources: OutboxEvent.recordFailure() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/domain/OutboxEvent.java:105; OutboxRetryPolicy.delay() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/application/OutboxRetryPolicy.java:35</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask9" name="FAILED | retain row&#10;Permanent error or exhausted budget&#10;No automatic re-drive">
      <bpmn:documentation>next_attempt_at=null; claimed_at not cleared on FAILED. No DELETE. Fencing protects DB bookkeeping, not duplicate Kafka sends.
Sources: OutboxEvent.recordFailure() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/domain/OutboxEvent.java:105</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow10" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway6" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask8" name="Yes: retry" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow11" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway6" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask9" name="No: terminal" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_consumer" name="FluxBank | Consumer retry and DLT" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:laneSet id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_consumer_lanes">
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_consumer_classify" name="Classify">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_consumer_retry" name="Retry / recover">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway19</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask21</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask22</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask12" name="Listener TX failure / invalid event&#10;DefaultErrorHandler&#10;transferEventsErrorHandler()">
      <bpmn:documentation>TransientDataAccessException, RecoverableDataAccessException, CannotCreateTransactionException retryable (nested causes). Other failures non-retryable: malformed JSON, invalid/legacy event, partial History, integrity errors.
Sources: TransferEventsConsumerConfiguration.transferEventsErrorHandler() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/infrastructure/kafka/TransferEventsConsumerConfiguration.java:43</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway13" name="Transient with retry left?">
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow14" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask12" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway13" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask15" name="Redeliver original source record&#10;FixedBackOff(1000 ms, 2 retries)&#10;Up to 3 business deliveries">
      <bpmn:documentation>Same eventId and source offset. Failed TX leaves no marker. Next delivery repeats listener/processor. See fluxbank-history-consumer-detail.bpmn.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask16" name="Publish to configured DLT&#10;DeadLetterPublishingRecoverer&#10;Wait for broker ACK">
      <bpmn:documentation>Destination partition -1; default topic fluxbank.transfer-events.v1.DLT. DelegatingByTypeSerializer sends normal event JSON or original malformed byte[]. setFailIfSendResultIsError(true); setResetStateOnRecoveryFailure(false).
Sources: TransferEventsConsumerConfiguration.transferEventsErrorHandler() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/infrastructure/kafka/TransferEventsConsumerConfiguration.java:43</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow17" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway13" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask15" name="Yes: retry" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow18" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway13" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask16" name="No: recover to DLT" />
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway19" name="DLT ACK received?">
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow20" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask16" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway19" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask21" name="Recovery complete&#10;Source offset may advance&#10;History was not created for this event">
      <bpmn:documentation>DLT ACK does not create History. No production DLT replay consumer or endpoint is implemented.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask22" name="DLT publication failed&#10;Source offset does not advance&#10;Seek / redelivery; retry recovery">
      <bpmn:documentation>Synchronous/asynchronous DLT failure or ACK timeout propagates. Original offset retained. Recovery failure does not reset the business retry budget.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow23" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway19" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask21" name="Yes" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_Flow24" sourceRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_exclusiveGateway19" targetRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_serviceTask22" name="No / timeout" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail">
    <bpmn:documentation>07 | Failure recovery, retry and DLT
Source: current working tree, 2026-11-08. Documentation only; isExecutable=false. Solid arrows = local execution order. Dashed arrows = HTTP/Kafka messages across pools. Green expanded subprocess = Spring database transaction, not BPMN compensation semantics. Red = failure; amber = retry/recovery. DB visibility is by commit and SELECT, not an in-memory message. Open README.md for the source index and linked pages.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_outbox_pool" name="FluxBank | Outbox retry / stale recovery" processRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_outbox" />
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_consumer_pool" name="FluxBank | Consumer retry and DLT" processRef="fluxbank-transfer-recovery-detail_consumer" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
